  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/9e04df580ba6da0ecdd7cf5633dca55c7902e6c5178135c0d0641f7528ff38d9.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure>\n\t\t\t&ensp;\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/a83269baf0096a9b12e672806d62ba648c33380734d513217d282a927e132922.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tGọi tấm bìa hình vuông là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, kí hiệu các điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>Q</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>J</mi></semantics></math> như hình vẽ. <br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTừ đó ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (cm).<br>\n\t\tĐộ dài <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cũng chính là chiều cao của hình chóp tứ giác đều nhận được.<br>\n\t\tThể tích của hình chóp tứ giác đều là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mrow><mn>200</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tXét hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>800</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có bảng biến thiên\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/6a192843cd18f6e0b526dd50738d6860856ffbf0c974d39b43dcaa5848ecdc3d.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tDo đó, thể tích hộp quà lớn nhất khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> cm.",
